    {
      "type": "NarrativeText",
      "text": "Phone: 9440254570 \u25cf Over 5.9 Years of experience in Software development. \u25cf Certified Anaplan Model Builder with Intensive experience of 3.5 years as Anaplan Model Builder. \u25cf Well experienced in end-to-end implementation of Anaplan Models, Modules, Dashboard, workflow, Lists, Actions. \u25cf Have Experienced with Integration concepts between various Models and working Knowledge of Anaplan Connect. \u25cf Experienced in Coordinating with onsite team members and development team. \u25cf Experience in responding to Request for Proposals (RFPs) and good experience in Anaplan Modeling, requirement gathering, solution design, build, Unit testing, debugging and Performance tuning with the industry best standards. \u25cf Ability to meet deadlines and handle multiple tasks in a pressured environment, proficient in report writing, decisive with strong leadership qualities, flexible in work schedules. \u25cf Versatile team player with excellent analytical, presentation and interpersonal skills with an aptitude to learn new technologies \u2022 Anaplan: Lists, Modules, Dashboards, Actions, Processes, Imports, User Role and Access Setup \u2022 Operating Systems: Windows 7/8/10, UNIX, Linux \u25cf Bachelor of Science from Rai Technology University Bengaluru Karnataka . \u2022 Anaplan Level 1 Model Builder \u2022 Anaplan Level 2 Model Builder. \u2022 Anaplan Level 3 Model Builder",
