      "text": "Prepared process document, user manuals and training guide for users. \u2022 Participate in unit testing and coordinated UAT for the end users. \u2022 Attending daily review meeting to solve issues, understand requirements and changes needed \u2022 Expert in using Application Lifecycle Management to manage the Development, Testing & Deployment of our Model. \u2022 Practiced Anaplan Agile Methodology for planning and execution on project deliverables from requirements. Project 3: Sales Planning Role: Anaplan Developer Team Size: 6 Responsibilities: \u2022 Translated the Business requirements to enterprise models with associated modules, lists/line items, \u2022 and calculations as supported by multi-dimensional Anaplan platform. \u2022 Developed several Dashboards like Operational & Reporting Dashboards for better understanding. \u2022 Experienced in coordinating with the Onsite Team members for optimizing the Business Scenario and accomplish the Project Goals. \u2022 Expert in using Application Lifecycle Management to manage the Development, Testing & Deployment of our Model. \u2022 Practiced Anaplan Agile Methodology for planning and execution on project deliverables from requirements.",
